                <object label="Hold out batches, document layouts, sites and later time periods.&#xa;Check retrieval recall; wrong-ID / wrong-version errors; numerical&#xa;correctness; missing-evidence recall; supported claims; abstention.&#xa;Report per-task mean / p95 and all-request mean, model + background&#xa;cost, human review time, and unresolved rate. Preserve failed runs." tooltip="Hold out batches, document layouts, sites and later time periods.&#xa;Check retrieval recall; wrong-ID / wrong-version errors; numerical&#xa;correctness; missing-evidence recall; supported claims; abstention.&#xa;Report per-task mean / p95 and all-request mean, model + background&#xa;cost, human review time, and unresolved rate. Preserve failed runs." implementationStatus="neutral" sourceFiles="" id="p4_44">
